SUMMARY:Ron Funches: Funchadelic LIVE at Hollywood Improv (The Lab)
DTSTAMP:20260816T033422Z
DTSTART:20260816T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nRon Funches: Funchade
	lic LIVE at Hollywood Improv (The Lab)\nComedian\, actor\, and podcaster R
	on Funches brings his “Funchadelic” show to the intimate Hollywood Improv 
	(The Lab) stage on August 16\, 2026. \nKnown for his warm\, joyful comedy 
	style and roles on Undateable and @midnight\, Ron Funches is one of the mo
	st beloved comedians working today. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August
	 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Hollywood Im
	prov (The Lab)\nAddress: 8162 Melrose Avenue\, Hollywood\, CA 90046\nAge R
	equirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\, first-come first-served\nNot
	e: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout Ron Funches\nRon Funches is 
	a comedian\, actor\, and writer known for his warm\, joyful comedy style. 
	He has appeared on Undateable\, @midnight\, and Powerless\, and has releas
	ed stand-up specials on Netflix. His podcast and social media presence hav
	e built him a devoted fanbase. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWarm\, joyful stand-up 
	from one of comedy’s most beloved performers\nThe Funchadelic show — a uni
	que comedy experience\nIntimate setting at the legendary Hollywood Improv 
	(The Lab)\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue Informatio
	n\nHollywood Improv (The Lab) is located at 8162 Melrose Avenue in Hollywo
	od\, CA. The Lab is an intimate room perfect for up-close comedy experienc
	es. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tic
	kets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains aff
	iliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our lin
	ks at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to c
	hange. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/ron-funches-funchadelic-live-at-hollywood-improv-the-lab-2/\n\n
	From Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ron-funches-funchadelic-live-at-hollyw
	ood-improv-the-lab-2/
LOCATION:Hollywood Improv (The Lab)\, 8162 Melrose Avenue\, Hollywood\, CA\
	, 90046\, United States
