DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nDrew Thomas LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nSt
	and-up comedian Drew Thomas headlines Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club inside MG
	M Grand in Las Vegas on August 18\, 2026. Joined by Brad Garrett himself\,
	 Drew brings his sharp observational humor and high-energy delivery to the
	 Strip for a night of laughs you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate
	: Tuesday\, August 18\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Brad Garrett’s Come
	dy Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109 (inside
	 MGM Grand)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nParking: MGM Grand 
	parking available \nAbout Drew Thomas\nDrew Thomas is a rising stand-up co
	median known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and high-energy 
	performances. He has toured extensively across the country and built a loy
	al following through his appearances at top comedy clubs and festivals. Dr
	ew’s comedy blends personal anecdotes with sharp cultural observations tha
	t resonate with audiences everywhere. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand
	-up set by Drew Thomas\nSpecial appearance by Brad Garrett\nIntimate showr
	oom setting inside MGM Grand\nSharp\, observational stand-up comedy\n18+ s
	how with adult humor\nBest available seating within purchased zone\n\nVenu
	e Information\nBrad Garrett’s Comedy Club is located inside the MGM Grand 
	Hotel & Casino on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering a premium comedy experien
	ce in an intimate setting with excellent sightlines and a lively atmospher
	e. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $86. Seating is best available
	 within the zone purchased — seats are not assigned until arrival. There i
	s an overall 8-ticket limit per order. All performers subject to change wi
	thout notice. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affi
	liate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our link
	s at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to ch
	ange. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.
	com/event/drew-thomas-live-at-brad-garretts-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Ca
	lendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/drew-thomas-live-at-brad-garretts-come
	dy-club/
LOCATION:Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\, 3799 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, N
	V\, 89109\, USA
